# PURPOSE: Keep the Docker build context (the repository root, see backend/platform.Dockerfile) small and free of anything secret or local. The Dockerfile copies only
#   backend/, gateway/tracking.py, gateway/packet.py, tools/fhir_export.py, eval/backend_client.py and viewer/triage.*; everything else is dropped before the build starts,
#   so a key, a decrypted secret or a recording that happens to be on the machine can never end up in an image layer by accident.
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
data
papers
docs
tests
firmware
ios
tools/*.sh
.github
.env
**/.env
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.crt
backend/pki
backend/.env
deploy/secrets
deploy/terraform
deploy/.sops.yaml
gateway/logs
gateway/outbox.db*
eval/results
.claude
.serena
.ua
.vscode
